{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>As a terrible storm rages on, Tabby finds herself once again trapped in a never-ending nightmare. Uncover the mystery of the curse or succumb to it in the sequel to the 2020 horror game, House.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586440/extras/99ab318a3ee642b1d44baa9e8f9f318a.poster.avif?t=1769541426\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586440/extras/99ab318a3ee642b1d44baa9e8f9f318a.webm?t=1769541426\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586440/extras/99ab318a3ee642b1d44baa9e8f9f318a.mp4?t=1769541426\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a house that changes and reacts to your actions in real-time </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different items to try and survive </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging, non-linear gameplay with multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play PS1-inspired games on the BarkStation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die in gruesomely elaborate ways in a hand-drawn story book artstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race against the clock to try and escape a deadly time-loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save or slay your family, the choice is yours...Or is it?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2586440?t=1769541426","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2586440?t=1769541426","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586440/4fd426bdb905905c2bf8e68584e7d